SeekFeedbackUpdate`. So, I'll instrument the code in `void_screen.dart` to log seek feedback when playback position changes and check the console output.\n\n**Adding Debug Prints for Validation**\n\nI want to quickly add `debugPrint` inside the callback to track when updates occur. Yeah, I know extra output might arise, but that\u2019s fine; I can always revert later, as I need to stay within budget. I\u2019ll update the `buildHeroGestureSurface` onSeekFeedbackUpdate closure to include `debugPrint('seekCrumbFeedback update $targetMs/$durationMs');` and potentially for the onSeekFeedbackEnd timer as well.\n\nAfter dragging, I\u2019ll check the flutter run logs for these strings to confirm if the callbacks were triggered. I\u2019ll locate the update closure in `void_screen.dart` around line 520 and make the necessary changes.","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0339ba09b38c0c4b016a89579c6f7481938de4bcae0ee81e5d\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABqiVekk1fCJ1s0dxXF_b2_InTFdUjn8gHxeLoYPvndYc5b6Ur_800jzC-zUAF3qSAy6syMAZgfxtu1xjnCt4tt3V-9erTKV0sHFzfCe4ukWf1DHDbBMDv-M9cA-8-SH0iVmDIgeMX9x1U5kuM6EmdSLhCIoRvlrdEagtV1lervq97kYWsPIuVuf5j-zF4mgR-pjpirAi4yWF-t-tscWy65WWLSo-tjUUANLsRhBjtfO5AHtqD_5GkEPE36u88fm2LJXgiUXMGTZEw29JnlWNK3JWboUhSUAYdioRxzBOTD4OG9sJXdqPqivRWTs3JdMhT6KTgVP5WZPoMDemG_2Ld6L5E2cYdZhrk5R04EptJWY4axtUJ5JL1CWYZM5ke11Sk6QxAI6zMQ5EU_nbZYubC6zQ8OAQh3fU_88G3yqfmaCtyh6uPbOyDx9McpnD4XBRKV30aqdezZugbWTeVGPlIHwG1Ptfy72nojIGlxN30PC7MX7ClCa1PJLGimodZHOQyh3qw42BnkcwgmlHv7W8Lrf6Z2vmBdW6ucTOh7iLYOrhGjup7CAQz2_t12nYVkAta35BACZ6ZpCltONVmkd5U3LoIUgevtMZl6x0LGn3v9eXGrY31J79PH27rOwLEFoMkII-YCLgq1JS0tR55NJg2IpTK4IGeIydephZn8uCA7MrI4UCk_HCzxaIFWN4_KtumFVaJOsYVQLLM9UA4R1vtV88NpM7rheBB3z6BUIw9UGtpEBf8xxJy_VKbNMdNmDpOAEOjQ0hfHETrEz1G8Bm2V7ht4dgILMWPjp6gD6CpbVFZmr6s0jQBLoJm1bPmei5LmRWCsD-ZyDFanOxgEApD8WZUu5tMR0TYW4S-ROyFIb50DYVRlwOiZF0zMWDLLwNSFAwVeLCCs-0DzQ5A0I2PEbHDtRNLzXytuS9mgVQxSbmXdhKGRvHma8ChuA68sshzwOo75CEBEQ6N-ByMdtXX-7FetjeaoGNfScoyhaLM9Rhwe31